    "title": "Methuen Plans Mosquito Treatments Monday Night - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WHAV News Staff ,\n1 hours ago Methuen will apply preventive mosquito control applications at parks, playgrounds, athletic fields and school recreation areas on Monday. City officials say Methuen is taking action sooner in the season to reduce mosquito populations before they become more widespread. Treatment takes place Monday, July 20, between about 9 p.m. and midnight. Applications are in coordination with the Northeast Massachusetts Mosquito Control and Wetlands Management District. There is a rain date of Tuesday, July 21. Read full article",
